{"title":"Thak Footman","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 45 Thak that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 43 times (1.6% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/thak-shield-boss\">Thak Shield Boss</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/quality-and-enchanting\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-footman\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-footman?lv=34\">Lv 34 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-footman?lv=35\">Lv 35 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-footman?lv=36\">Lv 36 <span>10</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-footman?lv=37\">Lv 37 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/thak-footman?lv=38\">Lv 38 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-footman?lv=39\">Lv 39 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-footman?lv=40\">Lv 40 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-footman?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>144</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-footman?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>141</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-footman?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>160</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-footman?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>946</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/thak-footman?lv=